WEBVTT
NOTE Wall Dance: audio description track (kind="descriptions").

d1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A person in round glasses, a dark red beanie, an olive jacket and a white T-shirt dances in front of a large mural of cartoon hands and green leaf shapes.

d2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
They step from side to side, swinging their arms and bending their knees in time to a beat we can’t hear.

d3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
They move to the left, roll their shoulders and finish facing the camera.
